{
  "title": "Tutorial Arc Player",
  "description": "Como configurar o Arc Player em sua Smart TV ou Android.",
  "content": {
    "type": "text",
    "data": "<div class='space-y-10'><div class='bg-blue-600/10 border-l-4 border-blue-500 p-6 rounded-r-2xl mb-8'><p class='text-blue-400 font-bold text-sm flex items-center gap-2'><i class='fas fa-info-circle'></i> Sobre o Arc Player</p><p class='text-gray-400 text-xs mt-1'>O Arc Player é um reprodutor moderno que utiliza IDs de dispositivo para gerenciamento de listas via site oficial.</p></div><section class='relative pl-12'><div class='absolute left-0 top-0 w-8 h-8 bg-blue-600 text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-black text-sm shadow-lg'>1</div><h4 class='text-lg font-black text-white uppercase tracking-tighter mb-4'>Pegue seus IDs</h4><p class='text-gray-400 text-xs mb-4'>Abra o Arc Player na sua TV e anote a <b>Key 1</b> e a <b>Key 2</b> que aparecem na tela de início.</p></section><section class='relative pl-12'><div class='absolute left-0 top-0 w-8 h-8 bg-indigo-600 text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-black text-sm shadow-lg'>2</div><h4 class='text-lg font-black text-white uppercase tracking-tighter mb-4'>Configuração via Site</h4><p class='text-gray-400 text-xs mb-6'>Acesse o site oficial do Arc Player para gerenciar sua playlist.</p><a href='https://www.arcplayer.com/manage' target='_blank' class='inline-flex items-center gap-3 bg-blue-600 hover:bg-blue-500 text-white font-black py-4 px-8 rounded-2xl transition-all shadow-xl uppercase text-[10px] tracking-widest mb-8'><i class='fas fa-external-link-alt'></i> Abrir Site Arc Player</a><div class='bg-[#1c2128] border border-gray-800 rounded-3xl p-6 space-y-4 shadow-xl'><p class='text-blue-400 font-bold text-xs mb-4 uppercase tracking-widest'>No site:</p><ul class='space-y-3'><li class='flex items-start gap-3'><i class='fas fa-check-circle text-emerald-500 mt-1'></i><p class='text-gray-400 text-[10px]'>Insira suas <b>Keys</b> para entrar no painel.</p></li><li class='flex items-start gap-3'><i class='fas fa-check-circle text-emerald-500 mt-1'></i><p class='text-gray-400 text-[10px]'>Adicione seu link <b>M3U Plus</b> no campo de playlist.</p></li><li class='flex items-start gap-3'><i class='fas fa-check-circle text-emerald-500 mt-1'></i><p class='text-gray-400 text-[10px]'>Clique em <b>Submit</b> ou <b>Save</b>.</p></li></ul></div></section><section class='relative pl-12'><div class='absolute left-0 top-0 w-8 h-8 bg-emerald-600 text-white rounded-full flex items-center justify-center font-black text-sm shadow-lg'>3</div><h4 class='text-lg font-black text-white uppercase tracking-tighter mb-4'>Recarregue na TV</h4><p class='text-gray-400 text-xs mb-4'>Reinicie o aplicativo na sua TV para que a lista de canais apareça.</p></section></div>"
  }
}